Z||000013||Tina||03-03-2001||09:11 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>Pep Boys!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> I hate Pep Boys!!! Ill NEVER shop there again! <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Second that, went in to return air filter<BR>(no reciept),and to buy $2000 worth of wheels and tires.<BR>Pep Boys: Sorry, no return without reciept.<BR>Me: Fine<P>I did stop back there a couple of days later.<BR>For my apointment to new wheels mounted.<P>With my new wheels I bought somewhere else,<BR>and the reciept for aircleaner.<P>The face on the managers face was priceless.<BR>After explaining to him that he lost $2000<BR>over a $15 air filter.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Revenge, is best served cold  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Tina<BR>||||reg||1
