Z||000015||Jaygee79||03-03-2001||02:44 PM||||I went in to Auto Zone once and asked for a part for an 88 Fiero.<P>Guy: "They didn't make Fieros in 88."<BR>Me: "Well that's funny because there's one sitting in your parking lot."<BR>  He goes to the window to see it.<BR>Guy: "Oh, I thought you said Camaro."<BR>Me: "Um, the Camaro was made in 88 too."<BR>Guy: "Oh, it was?"<BR>&lt;silence&gt;<p>[This message has been edited by Jaygee79 (edited 03-03-2001).]||||reg||1
